            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f2" n="52" xml:id="d137-f2-content">
                <p>The second memorandum was dated January 15, 1944; neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f3" n="53" xml:id="d137-f3-content">
